            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Catjong 2 on a cozy mahjong-3 winter adventure! Match tiles through 200 joyful levels and relax in a festive Alpine fair. Between puzzles, rebuild and decorate snowy chalets, twinkling lights, and cheerful market stalls. Easy to learn and delightful to play – every puzzle leaves warm Pawprints in the Snow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 delightful mahjong-3 levels for any moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful cat companion adds charm and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild and decorate a cozy Alpine winter fair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, accessible gameplay with warm holiday vibes</p></li></ul>",
